{"id":"a432614896241213","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_L3EvalRow.md","title":"L3EvalRow","display":"L3EvalRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"L3EvalRow","parameters":["v","Q","h"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"L3EvalRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>v</span><span>Q</span><span>h</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：三值语义与有限表证书。有序参数：<code>v</code>、<code>Q</code>、<code>h</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ L3EvalRow v Q h)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ L3PartialVal v)\n  (and\n    (exists three (and (@ Num3 three) (@ Map h Q three)))\n    (forall a\n      (forall b\n        (implies\n          (@ App h a b)\n          (or\n            (exists n (and (@ PAtom n a) (@ App v n b)))\n            (or\n              (and (@ PBot a) (@ Num0 b))\n              (or\n                (exists p (exists x (and (@ PNeg p a) (and (@ App h p x) (@ L3Neg x b)))))\n                (exists p\n                  (exists q\n                    (exists x (exists y (and (@ PImp p q a) (and (@ App h p x) (and (@ App h q y) (@ L3Imp x y b))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e0d30adc92d51179\" href=\"?note=e0d30adc92d51179\" title=\"ZFC_L3Imp\">L3Imp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"45346a8e861cbc4a\" href=\"?note=45346a8e861cbc4a\" title=\"ZFC_L3Neg\">L3Neg</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e662d8dd61767d1d\" href=\"?note=e662d8dd61767d1d\" title=\"ZFC_L3PartialVal\">L3PartialVal</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b242e5082334b5f2\" href=\"?note=b242e5082334b5f2\" title=\"ZFC_Map\">Map</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e8cec2782b4668b5\" href=\"?note=e8cec2782b4668b5\" title=\"ZFC_Num0\">Num0</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"328ced6f64afa4d9\" href=\"?note=328ced6f64afa4d9\" title=\"ZFC_Num3\">Num3</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"30627acf823af3c5\" href=\"?note=30627acf823af3c5\" title=\"ZFC_PAtom\">PAtom</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"8839a547e393d0af\" href=\"?note=8839a547e393d0af\" title=\"ZFC_PBot\">PBot</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"88931f785a07870f\" href=\"?note=88931f785a07870f\" title=\"ZFC_PImp\">PImp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"1ee75039aeffe56b\" href=\"?note=1ee75039aeffe56b\" title=\"ZFC_PNeg\">PNeg</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ L3EvalRow v Q h)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_L3Imp|L3Imp]]；[[ZFC_L3Neg|L3Neg]]；[[ZFC_L3PartialVal|L3PartialVal]]；[[ZF